Cell["\<\
ExtraMicrowaveLinewidth is the additional full effective microwave linewidth \
on resonance. At nonzero detuning use the complex SigmaPerp, not a constant \
broadening. The output-port factor in the numerator remains fixed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ddbdb93a-4e43-0443-8741-7557f0b57e3f"]
}, Open  ]],

