Cell["\<\
etaOpt and etaMM are additional desired-port fractions multiplying the \
original notebook result at fixed total cavity linewidths. They are set to \
one below. If changing mirror/port coupling also changes the linewidths, \
update kappa and kappamu consistently; the port factors alone do not describe \
that redesign.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c48e47cd-d33f-9045-9613-126d1566153d"]
}, Open  ]],

